# Pinned SHA-256 of the prebuilt diy-tools squashfs artifacts published by the
# seedsigner-diy-tools repo (https://github.com/3rdIteration/seedsigner-diy-tools).
#
# These hashes are reproduced by the reproducible build in that repo, so they are
# stable per release tag. mdev.sh re-checks the microSD's diy-tools.squashfs
# against this file before mounting (fail-closed), and each smartcard profile's
# post-image script verifies the downloaded artifact against the same value.
#
# Bump these when cutting a new seedsigner-diy-tools release (and update the
# DIY_TAG in the post-image scripts to match).
armhf:22e289c2caa58ed4d460735b03155a57537fa7e29b354ca4fc72a508fe3bdff8
aarch64:9228bf5e60f8a94f537f26414c7a0401f75a87ef85ca0460e887356d9cdb0f2b
